+| SEC-03 — Local Passwords | ✓ | ✓ | △ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | **۱۰ ✓، ۱ △** |
+| SEC-06 — ACL | ✓ | ✓ | △ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | △ | **۹ ✓، ۲ △** |
